ROX-Filer 2.12 GTK3 r8 - 2026-07-25
------------------------------------------
- Added consistent source attribution comments to GTK3 port blocks and new
  features using "Agregado por josejp2424" and "Modificado por josejp2424".
- Added file-level attribution notices only to files containing GTK3 port
  changes, while preserving the original copyright and GPL notices.
- Marked the action completion protocol, terminal integration, native About
  dialog, 600x400 geometry, scrollable Options window and icon-theme support.
- Added syntax-appropriate attribution comments to shell, Autoconf, Makefile,
  XML, CSS and requested translation catalogues.

ROX-Filer 2.12 GTK3 r7 - 2026-07-25
------------------------------------------
- Set the Options window initial geometry to 600x400 pixels.
- Added independent scrolling to every Options page so large sections no
  longer force the dialog to span almost the full monitor width.
- Added a compact scrollable section tree on the left side of Options.
- Removed the Help button from the main filer toolbar, including its callback
  and its entry in the toolbar customisation list.

ROX-Filer 2.12 GTK3 - source revision r6

- Replaced the historical images/application.png, dirs.png, iconified.png, mount, mounted, select, details, xattr and symlink resources with icons from the active GTK3 icon theme.
- Kept only images/rox-show-hidden.png as a fallback when the current theme does not provide view-hidden-files.
- Added compatibility aliases for historical ROX image names and symbolic icon variants.
- Removed Help, Show Help Files and Manual from filer, desktop-icon and AppDir contextual menus.
- Kept the native About ROX-Filer dialog as a direct contextual entry.
- Retained the real 600 x 400 initial filer geometry and terminal integration from revision r5.

ROX-Filer 2.12 GTK3 - CHANGELOG
=================================

Version 2.12 GTK3 (2026-07-25)
-------------------------------

Project and credits
* Based on ROX-Filer 2.11 by Thomas Leonard and the ROX Desktop contributors.
* Original licence retained: GNU General Public License, version 2 or later.
* GTK3 port, compatibility work and new features by josejp2424.
* This GTK3 version is maintained by josejp2424.

GTK3 port
* Revision r3 attempted to set a 400 x 400 default-size hint, but the initial GTK3 auto-resizer could still overwrite it before mapping.
* Revision r4 replaced that incomplete approach with a real post-map 500 x 500 resize.
* Revision r5 changes the standard post-map geometry to 600 x 400 pixels.
* Saved per-directory window geometry continues to override the standard size.
* The 600 x 400 value is only an initial size and does not restrict manual resizing.
* Ported the filer interface from GTK2-era APIs to GTK3 public APIs.
* Reworked collection drawing with Cairo and a GTK3 GtkDrawingArea.
* Restored pointer input, selection, double-click, drag and context menus.
* Reworked scrolling so Collection, GtkViewport and the scrollbar share a valid GtkAdjustment.
* Removed fixed interface colours and allowed the active GTK3 theme to style filer views.
* The system theme is obtained normally by GTK3, including ~/.config/gtk-3.0/settings.ini.
* Updated menu, icon, toolbar, dialog, grid, clipboard and window APIs for GTK3.
* Kept X11-specific ROX desktop, pinboard and panel behaviour through public GDK-X11 APIs.

File operations
* Added an explicit operation-complete protocol message between action child processes and the GTK interface.
* Action windows no longer depend only on a pipe hang-up notification to close.
* Fixed the GTK3 GIO pipe watcher when G_IO_IN and G_IO_HUP arrive together.
* Buffered child messages are now drained before the watch is removed, so the final completion message is not lost.
* Fixed copy, overwrite and recursive-delete dialogs remaining open after the filesystem operation had completed.
* Added safe G_IO_HUP, G_IO_ERR and G_IO_NVAL fallback handling after pending input has been consumed.
* Retained the existing error report window when an operation has real errors.

Terminal integration
* Added "Open Terminal Here" to the selected-item context menu; it is enabled for exactly one selected folder.
* F4 and the Window menu also open inside a selected folder, otherwise they use the current filer directory.
* Added "Run in Terminal" for executable binaries, executable scripts, .sh files, .py/.pyw files and AppImages.
* Executable items are launched directly, shell scripts use /bin/sh and Python scripts use python3.
* AppImages without execute permission show a translated warning and are never modified silently.
* The configured terminal command is parsed safely and receives separate arguments through -e.
* The terminal remains open after completion until RETURN is pressed.
* Both context entries use the standard utilities-terminal icon from the active icon theme.

Icon-theme integration
* Toolbar, menu, mount, symlink, extended-attribute, AppDir, directory and iconified-window graphics now come from the active GTK3 icon theme.
* Historical bundled resources map to folder, application-x-executable, view-list, edit-select-all, drive-harddisk, media-eject, document-properties and emblem-symbolic-link.
* Symbolic variants are selected automatically when a theme does not provide the regular icon name.
* view-hidden-files is used when available; images/rox-show-hidden.png is the only retained compatibility image.
* Removed the other nine obsolete PNG resources from ROX-Filer/images.

Context menus
* Removed the Help branch, Show Help Files and Manual from the main filer context menu.
* Removed Show Help Files and Manual from pinboard and panel icon context menus.
* Removed the automatic Help item from application-directory contextual menus.
* Kept About ROX-Filer as a direct entry backed by the native GtkAboutDialog.
* The Help directory remains in the source because it contains the original manual and GPL licence text.

Internationalisation
* Preserved the original translations for German, Spanish, French, Italian, Portuguese, Japanese, Hungarian, Russian and Chinese.
* Added Catalan and Arabic catalogues for the principal interface, menus and file-operation dialogs.
* All terminal integration labels, errors and completion text are translated in every requested catalogue.
* Bundled compiled message catalogues so translations work without development tools.
* The build script refreshes the selected catalogues when msgfmt and iconv are available.
* Locale detection now respects LANGUAGE, LC_ALL, LC_MESSAGES and LANG.

About dialog and metadata
* Version displayed as ROX-Filer 2.12 GTK3.
* Replaced the external AppInfo-based About window with a native GtkAboutDialog in the source.
* Moved About ROX-Filer out of the Help submenu.
* Preserved the original author, contributors and GPL licence information.
* Added josejp2424 as GTK3 port author, new-feature contributor and maintainer of this version.

Source cleanup
* Removed the individual STEP, STATUS, compile-fix and verification documents.
* Consolidated the port history into this single CHANGELOG file.
